OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast with rain persisting   
OL,6,Ffor many places, with only limited     
OL,7,Fdrier spells and the rain heavy at     
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling rather cold, especially 
OL,9,Falong the coast where it will be windy 
OL,10,Fat first.                              
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud and outbreaks of rain   
OL,13,Fwill gradually move away southwards.   
OL,14,FClearer conditions follow to many      
OL,15,Fplaces, leading to a slight frost and  
OL,16,Fa risk of ice on untreated surfaces.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
